From 4ce5bd170d441124f9e105153ef425f90bac373c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomchild411 <143453386+atomchild411@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:10:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] IRIX: WTF/JSC/WebCore/WebKit port (spike)

OS(IRIX); stack bounds, RSS and RAM size from /proc and sysmp; no mincore,
RealTimeThreads or STACK_BOUNDS_FOR_NEW_THREAD; HZ undef; IPC over
SOCK_DGRAM (no AF_UNIX SEQPACKET); shared memory files under /tmp
(shm_open names are paths); IPC glib coders renamed for case-insensitive
build hosts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
